    count: 3-4 blue(1) 4-connected components on the background
    hollow: 1-2 components have exactly 1 enclosed rectangular hole (4-conn bg region fully inside bbox)
    solid: 1-3 components without enclosed holes
    cell_count: 1-125 per component; hollow >= 10, solid any size
    hole_size: 2-16 cells, always rectangular (1x2 to 4x4)
    shape: |
      irregular polyominoes; each row of the component is NOT necessarily contiguous
      (the hole creates non-contiguous rows). Shapes typically look like a large
